WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:16,470
Take the drone back and take a detour

2
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:17,700
leave now

3
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:20,080
How could it be

4
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:22,010
Have you finished eating those people?

5
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:25,410
Impossible, even if you finish eating

6
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:26,890
Why did you come here by such a coincidence?

7
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:28,050
they know i'm here

8
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:32,260
Contact Li Wei'an and Ji Feifan to ask them to come back

9
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:50,140
Those crazy people are walking up the mountain

10
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:51,580
at that speed

11
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,940
Return to Shanjiao soon

12
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:55,700
By then we will be stuck here waiting.

13
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:59,010
Don’t abandon, don’t give up, if it’s you

14
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:03,250
Do you want me to leave now? Half an hour

15
00:01:03,570 --> 00:01:04,690
There's no news yet. I'll go find someone.

16
00:01:04,690 --> 00:01:06,810
Now everyone packs up
